<title>JAPAN: Shin-Hokoku Steel - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Shin-Hokoku Steel - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  1.23		vs	    1.07</p>
<p> Operating     loss 1    million	  vs     loss 4    million</p>
<p> Current	     28    million	  vs	   21    million</p>
<p> Net	    loss 21    million	  vs	  prft 7 million</p>
<p> EPS	     loss 5.88 yen	  vs     prft 2.01 yen</p>
<p> Shares		4 million	  vs	   4 million</p>
<p>NOTE - Shin-Hokoku Steel Corp is a leading maker of cast steel products for blast furnaces.</p>
</text>
